<title>USA: Questron Technology Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Questron Technology Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 months ended March 31,	1997	     1996</p>
<p>Revenue:</p>
<p>  Sales			  $ 3,896,764    $ 2,767,137</p>
<p>  Fee income			  15,513	   51,363</p>
<p>				     3,912,277	2,818,500</p>
<p>Operating costs and expenses:</p>
<p>Cost of products and</p>
<p>   services sold		 2,328,374	1,675,487</p>
<p> SG&amp;A				1,086,020	  861,354</p>
<p> Depreciation and amortization  79,870	   64,272</p>
<p>				     3,494,264	2,601,113</p>
<p> Operating income		  418,013	  217,387</p>
<p> Interest expense		   60,209	   79,160</p>
<p> Income before income taxes    357,804	  138,227</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes     32,750	   20,953</p>
<p> Net income			  325,054	  117,274</p>
<p> Net EPS				   .17		.08</p>
<p> Avg shrs outstanding	  1,968,091	1,541,039</p>
<p>NOTE: Sales attributable to the fasteners and electronic hardware distribution businesses of Quest and Webb were $3,896,764 in the 1997 quarter, compared with $2,767,137 in the prior year period.</p>
<p>The 1997 quarter includes the results of Webb for one month, as the acquisition of Webb was completed in early March.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
